<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2856] Do not generate index fields when them is absent in query fields</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2856</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Schema import utility can generate index fields that is exclude from query fields.&lt;br/&gt;
Also in index field name should be used java name instead of database name which is showed now&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
