                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15223764" author="vsisko" created="Mon, 4 Apr 2016 07:26:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented filtration of index fields.&lt;br/&gt;
Fixed name of index field to java name.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15223831" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 4 Apr 2016 08:40:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please review and test with my changes.&lt;br/&gt;
You need to test indexes with one and several fields.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15223860" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 4 Apr 2016 09:18:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master. Please test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To test:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Create table in DB with several indexes: index for one field and index for several fields.&lt;br/&gt;
In schema import utility &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;import metadata for this table (all fields) - index should be generated.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;uncheck some fields th UI - index should be generated ONLY if all query fields that specified in index checked in UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="15227917" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 08:02:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Unchecked fields still present in QueryEntity in XML configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15230010" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 7 Apr 2016 09:46:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed generation of indexes in XML configuration.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15234180" author="kuaw26" created="Sun, 10 Apr 2016 16:29:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good for me. Please take a look on my changings. Retest and if all OK submit for QA to Pavel.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15234700" author="pkonstantinov" created="Mon, 11 Apr 2016 08:37:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;You fixed another place, but I&apos;m sad about QueryEntity in the XML configuration(ignite-type-metadata.xml) and in the Java configuration (CacheConfig.java).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15236985" author="vsisko" created="Tue, 12 Apr 2016 10:58:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed adding of unused fields from query fields. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2856&quot; title=&quot;Do not generate index fields when them is absent in query fields&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-2856&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-2856&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15238529" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 13 Apr 2016 03:27:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Successfully tested in branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15238603" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 13 Apr 2016 04:42:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master. Please retest and close.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15259707" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 27 Apr 2016 07:32:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
